#| msgid "Setup instructions for IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK and Qiskit Runtime jobs for users without email invitations"
msgid "Setup instructions for IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK and IBM Quantum Compute Service jobs for users without email invitations"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-setup ng IBM Quantum sa IBM Cloud para sa pagsumite ng mga Qiskit SDK at Qiskit Runtime na trabaho para sa mga gumagamit na walang email na imbitasyon"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up your IBM Cloud account"
msgstr "I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up your IBM Cloud account {#set-up-your-ibm-cloud-account}"
msgstr "I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account {#set-up-your-ibm-cloud-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you were emailed an invitation to join an account, follow the steps in [Set up your IBM Cloud account - invited users](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) instead.\n"
msgstr "Kung nakatanggap ka ng email na imbitasyon para sumali sa isang account, sundin ang mga hakbang sa [I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account - mga inimbitahang gumagamit](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) sa halip.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "You can run workloads on IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs) by setting up an account on IBM Cloud&reg;. You will also need to [install and set up Qiskit and Qiskit Runtime](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgid "You can run workloads on IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs) by setting up an account on IBM Cloud&reg;. You will also need to [install and set up Qiskit and the IBM Quantum Compute client](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr "Maaari kang magpatakbo ng mga workload sa IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs) sa pamamagitan ng pag-set up ng account sa IBM Cloud&reg;. Kakailanganin mo ring [i-install at i-set up ang Qiskit at Qiskit Runtime](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your user account is associated with one or more [instances](/guides/instances) identified by _Cloud Resource Names_ (CRNs) that give access to IBM Quantum services. Additionally, a unique API token (also called a key) is assigned to each account, allowing for IBM Quantum access from Qiskit.  For instructions to choose a specific instance, see [Connect to an instance](./instances#connect-instance).\n"
msgstr "Ang iyong user account ay naka-ugnay sa isa o higit pang [mga instance](/guides/instances) na tinutukoy ng _Cloud Resource Names_ (CRNs) na nagbibigay ng access sa mga serbisyo ng IBM Quantum. Bukod dito, isang natatanging API token (tinatawag din na key) ang itinalaga sa bawat account, na nagbibigay-daan sa pag-access sa IBM Quantum mula sa Qiskit. Para sa mga tagubilin sa pagpili ng isang partikular na instance, tingnan ang [Kumonekta sa isang instance](./instances#connect-instance).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Cloud {#set-up-to-use-ibm-cloud}"
msgstr "I-set up para gamitin ang IBM Cloud {#set-up-to-use-ibm-cloud}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not already have one, set up an [IBM Cloud account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You can be part of multiple IBM Cloud accounts.  You can access any of your IBM Cloud accounts at any time from the account switcher in the header of the [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) interface.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung wala ka pa, mag-set up ng [IBM Cloud account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Maaari kang maging bahagi ng maraming IBM Cloud account. Maaari mong ma-access ang alinman sa iyong mga IBM Cloud account anumang oras mula sa account switcher sa header ng interface ng [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) with an IBMid or Google account.  If you don't have one, you are guided through creating one. (These login credentials are not your IBM Cloud account credentials.)\n"
msgstr "Mag-log in sa [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) gamit ang IBMid o Google account. Kung wala ka pa, gagabayan ka sa paglikha ng isa. (Ang mga login credential na ito ay hindi ang iyong mga IBM Cloud account credential.)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account switcher in the header, as shown in the following image.\n"
msgstr "Siguraduhing napili ang tamang account at rehiyon sa account switcher sa header, tulad ng ipinapakita sa sumusunod na larawan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    The region controls where your jobs are run and where the job data is kept. You can access either region by using the same API key, but you can only see and access the instances that were created in the region that you're logged in to.\n"
msgstr "    Ang rehiyon ang nagkokontrol kung saan pinapatakbo ang iyong mga trabaho at kung saan iniingatan ang data ng trabaho. Maaari mong ma-access ang alinmang rehiyon gamit ang parehong API key, ngunit makikita at ma-access mo lamang ang mga instance na nilikha sa rehiyong kung saan ka naka-log in.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is to the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is to the right of the account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.avif 'IBM Quantum Platform header')\n"
msgstr "    ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is to the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is to the right of the account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.avif 'IBM Quantum Platform header')\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Create an instance {#1-create-an-instance}"
msgstr "1. Lumikha ng instance {#1-create-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can create an instance from the IBM Quantum Platform [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.  See [Create an instance](/guides/instances#add-instance) for detailed instructions.\n"
msgstr "Maaari kang lumikha ng instance mula sa pahina ng [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) ng IBM Quantum Platform. Tingnan ang [Lumikha ng instance](/guides/instances#add-instance) para sa mga detalyadong tagubilin.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Optional: Save your access credentials {#2-optional-save-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "2. Opsyonal: I-save ang iyong mga access credential {#2-optional-save-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are using a trusted Python environment, such as a personal laptop, it is recommended that you use the `save_account()` method to [save your credentials locally](/guides/save-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Kung gumagamit ka ng pinagkakatiwalaang Python na kapaligiran, tulad ng personal na laptop, inirerekomenda na gamitin ang `save_account()` na paraan para [i-save ang iyong mga credential nang lokal](/guides/save-credentials).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Connect Qiskit with your service instance {#3-connect-qiskit-with-your-service-instance}"
msgstr "3. Ikonekta ang Qiskit sa iyong service instance {#3-connect-qiskit-with-your-service-instance}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Initialize the service](/guides/initialize-account) in a **trusted Python environment**\n"
msgstr "[I-initialize ang serbisyo](/guides/initialize-account) sa isang **pinagkakatiwalaang Python na kapaligiran**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Initialize the service in an **untrusted environment**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) (such as a public computer)\n"
msgstr "[I-initialize ang serbisyo sa isang **hindi pinagkakatiwalaang kapaligiran**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) (tulad ng pampublikong computer)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"   * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"   * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga Tala\">\n"
"   * Sundin ang [mga tagubiling ito](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) kung gusto mong kumonekta gamit ang REST API sa halip na Qiskit.\n"
"   * Kung kinakailangan, gamitin ang [impormasyong ito](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) para i-configure ang iyong firewall upang paganahin ang access sa mga IBM Quantum API endpoint.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Overview of available plans](plans-overview).\n"
"  -  [Configure the Qiskit SDK locally](configure-qiskit-local).\n"
"  -  [View your available QPUs](/guides/qpu-information#available).\n"
"  -  Follow the steps in the [Run your first circuit on hardware](/guides/hello-world) guide to write and run a quantum program.\n"
"  -  [Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
"  -  Try a [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"  -  [Pangkalahatang-ideya ng mga available na plano](plans-overview).\n"
"  -  [I-configure ang Qiskit SDK nang lokal](configure-qiskit-local).\n"
"  -  [Tingnan ang iyong mga available na QPU](/guides/qpu-information#available).\n"
"  -  Sundin ang mga hakbang sa gabay na [Patakbuhin ang iyong unang circuit sa hardware](/guides/hello-world) para magsulat at magpatakbo ng quantum program.\n"
"  -  [I-set up para gamitin ang IBM Quantum Platform gamit ang REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
"  -  Subukan ang isang [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
